# Diablo IV (fenris) TACT decryption keys — public, community-harvested.
#
# Format: KEYNAME (16 hex) <space> KEYVALUE (32 hex), one per line — the same
# wowdev format as https://github.com/wowdev/TACTKeys. KEYNAME is the BLTE
# lookup id (the u64 the block header resolves to), i.e. the byte-swap of the
# on-disk `EncryptedNameDict-0x<id>.dat` filename hex.
#
# These are baked into the binary at build (see key_service::build_table). To
# add keys you harvest yourself without rebuilding, drop them in your per-user
# key file instead — see the "Encrypted Files & TACT Keys" section of README.
#
# NOTE ON COMPLETENESS: D4 streams keys to the client at runtime and only the
# keys for content the client has touched are ever resident in memory, so no
# harvest is ever complete. Every key below is decrypt-verified (the matching
# EncryptedNameDict file decodes to a valid 0xABCD4567 header). Last verified
# against a live client on 2026-07-21.

